# Apple firmware and device dumps are copyrighted / personal: never commit them.
*.ipsw
Firmware-*
# The pattern above also matches docs/firmware-format.md and the notes re/firmware-*.md,
# because Git on macOS ignores the case of a letter. Keep the documents.
!docs/*.md
!re/firmware-*.md
*.bin
*.img
backups/
# A copy of the folder iPod_Control holds the music, the games and the identity of an
# iPod. The files are copyrighted or personal.
iPod_Control/
# Music files (for example the MIDI file for re/midi-to-tones.py) are copyrighted.
*.mid
*.midi
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.m4b
*.m4p
*.aac
*.wav
*.aiff
*.flac
# An iPod key file is personal.
*.sidb
work/

# The guide that removes iPodFirm by hand is a local document. It names the files
# and the folders of one Mac. The rule comes after the rule "!docs/*.md" so that
# the guide stays out of the repository.
docs/uninstall.md

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
dist/

# macOS Finder files
.DS_Store

# The local settings of Claude Code
.claude/
